    "deprecation": ".changeset/schedule-live-connector-accounts.md",
    "removedInMajor": 2,
    "sunset": "2026-10-12",
    "reason": "Schedules no longer save connector accounts. Every run uses the owner's current accounts, and only a person can pin accounts (pinnedAccounts) on a schedule that starts its own session. The old field silently froze a snapshot of accounts, so it is removed in one cutover without an alias; requests that still send connectionAccounts are rejected with a validation error."
  },
